WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:04.750
The Gomu Gomu no mi is not what you think
it is.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:10.110
There is a reason, why Shanks went out of
his way to steal the fruit and a reason why

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.959
it makes Luffy so special.

00:00:12.959 --> 00:00:15.990
And it's time to find out what it is.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:21.080
Because maybe shanks used the fruit to determine
the man who can bring the dawn.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:28.619
And maybe, just maybe, it's not actually the
Gomu Gomu no mi after all, but a mythical

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:32.880
devil fruit.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:41.190
Hi my name is Manu, and as you can tell, I
have been on a bit of a streak with videos

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:42.190
on Luffy lately.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:46.500
Even though Zoro is my favorite Character,
Luffy is not far behind for me.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.690
And I have made several videos already about
why I think he's the best-written shounen

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.930
protagonist out there.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:58.320
But recent developments in One Piece have
had me obsessed about Luffy's true nature

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:04.820
and powers and how Oda is clearly teasing
us with something about Luffy that he's deliberately

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:06.510
holding back right now.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:10.750
For the longest time, it seemed to me like
Luffy eating the Gomu Gomu no mi was merely

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.750
a coincidence.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.640
He was hanging out with Shanks and his men,
who had brought the fruit with them and while

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.300
they were looking away Luffy took it as a
nice little snack in between.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.780
Good for you luffy, eating healthy.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.580
Later Shanks apparently on a whim saw something
special in Luffy, so he motivated him to become

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:38.100
a pirate and gave him his hat as inspiration.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:42.840
And it was only thanks to Luffy's creativity
that the Gomu Gomu no mi seemed more than

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.850
average at best to me as a power.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:45.850
AH.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.850
Remember when one piece seemed that simple.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:50.090
Now everything has seemed to have changed
and to me this first chapter of One Piece

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:55.340
seems filled to the brim with foreshadowing
and setup for the endgame of the story.

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:02.590
But looking at all I have to share with you
in this video, it's so exciting, I can't really

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.590
complain.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:07.830
With Oden's flashback, we have gotten a lot
of new insights into the workings of Roger

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.869
and his journey to Laugh Tale.

00:02:09.869 --> 00:02:14.980
Shanks has turned out to be one of the most
influential characters in the story, with

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:19.849
ties to Roger, the other Yonko and the Gorosei
alike.

00:02:19.849 --> 00:02:25.709
Instead of a simple pirate that likes to party
most of the time, he is the man pulling the

00:02:25.709 --> 00:02:32.169
strings on political developments and the
future of the world---and still likes to party

00:02:32.169 --> 00:02:38.639
most of the time.

00:02:38.639 --> 00:02:43.840
As you might know, I'm convinced that Shanks
did not simply show up in Fusha Village, because

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.739
he was aimlessly sailing around the east blue.

00:02:46.739 --> 00:02:51.200
Shanks was extremely close to Roger and even
inherited his precious straw hat.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:56.480
We now know that Roger and his men came to
Laugh Tale to early and that the pirate king

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:05.760
was waiting for the one who could bring 
the dawn.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:12.129
That's why he created the new pirate era to
inspire as many people as possible to find

00:03:12.129 --> 00:03:13.129
it.

00:03:13.129 --> 00:03:18.180
He then ordered his men, to find the right
person and guide him towards the last island,

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.109
to find the one piece.

00:03:21.109 --> 00:03:25.359
That is why Rayleigh was waiting at the entrance
to the new world, as the only one able to

00:03:25.359 --> 00:03:31.309
coat ships, keeping a close eye on everyone
who came though and immediately recognising

00:03:31.309 --> 00:03:36.169
Luffy for who he was.

00:03:36.169 --> 00:03:44.219
Why crocus was guarding the entrance to the
Grandline at reverse mountain, where he surely

00:03:44.219 --> 00:03:48.359
recognised Luffy the same way and made sure
he found his way.

00:03:48.359 --> 00:04:02.700
I bet he didn't give out a free log pose to
everyone and explained how to use it.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:09.620
And finally, Shanks was tasked with finding
the right member of the D. Family to inherit

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.620
Rogers Will.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:16.630
I would bet my favorite coffee mug, that Shanks
came to Fusha village to find Ace, not Luffy,

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:27.490
the son of his former captain, that was determined
on having a son of his own to succeed him.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:32.020
And it's the same reason, he left right away,
never to be seen in the east blue again, right

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:37.330
after entrusting Luffy with Roger's hat and
sacrificing his arm to ensure he would become

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.730
the one who can bring the dawn.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:46.240
Whether he knew how powerful luffy would become
and who his parents were, I don't know.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:51.789
However, I will make videos on both, Luffy's
possible powers after Wano and a who his mother

00:04:51.789 --> 00:04:58.880
might be soon, so if you want to see those
and are a true mad-lad, make sure to subscribe.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:03.919
And now, with recent chapters, speculation
around devil fruits and more specifically

00:05:03.919 --> 00:05:07.539
Luffy's fruit has gotten a lot of fresh wind.

00:05:07.539 --> 00:05:11.860
From here on out Spoiler warning if you are
not caught up with the story yet.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:15.930
I was completely shocked, when we found out
form Who's Who that Shanks did not simply

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:21.360
stumble across this specific devil fruit,
but went out of his way to steal if from the

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.370
world government itself, while it was protected
by CP9.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:33.180
That and the reveal of Sun God Nika, which
will actually be important later on.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:37.949
And so it now begs the question, whether Shanks
didn't just chose Luffy as the next possible

00:05:37.949 --> 00:05:44.039
pirate king, because he reminded him of Roger,
but because Luffy snacked on the most important

00:05:44.039 --> 00:05:50.960
fruit in the whole story.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:55.560
And so I now want to discuss with you all
the exciting possibilities for what could

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:59.360
possibly make a the rubber devil fruit so
special.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.900
But before we eat desert, first some veggies.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.680
Let's assume that the fruit wasn't special
after all?

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:12.229
Why did Shanks go out of his way and risk
war with the government to steal it, if it

00:06:12.229 --> 00:06:14.879
wasn't super important to him?

00:06:14.879 --> 00:06:19.930
One possibility could be that shanks actually
made a bit of a woopie when stealing the fruit.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:25.700
Since he seems to have been the only one aware
of how dangerous blackbeard truly is, he might

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:30.789
well be aware of his connection to Rocks D.
Xebec or wherever Teach got the idea for the

00:06:30.789 --> 00:06:39.349
Yami Yami no mi from.

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:45.220
Maybe the government mistook the gomu gomu
no mi for its much more powerful counterpart

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:49.000
and information about it leaked through to
Shanks.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:54.120
Only after stealing the fruit did he realize
that he had not gotten his hands on the Yami

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.410
Yami no mi after all.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:01.580
Another possibility is that one of the celestial
dragons had purchased Luffy's fruit for a

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:10.820
lot of money and wanted to use it for one
of their slaves, which is why CP9 was instructed

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.210
with its transport.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:17.020
But I personally think, that Oda wouldn't
have gone out of his way to bring Shanks stealing

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:22.620
the fruit from the government up like this,
if it weren't important in some way or form.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.740
As I discussed in my character analysis of
shanks, he is someone that usually tries to

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:32.139
avoid conflict and fighting, trying to be
the mediator with pirates and the gorosei

00:07:32.139 --> 00:07:34.139
alike.

00:07:34.139 --> 00:07:42.370
So, I feel there must be something very special
about the Gomu Gomu no mi, for him to actually

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.180
attack a government ship.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:50.180
I think that the fruit is special in some
way and Shanks used it to find the next Joy

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.180
boy.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:57.080
So, once Luffy had eaten it, there was no
alternative for him, but to bet everything

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.080
on Luffy.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.930
So what could be so special about it?

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:05.240
I think there are three different options
here.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:10.879
Number 1: It's not about the fruit itself,
but who wielded it before luffy.

00:08:10.879 --> 00:08:16.060
Number 2: The fruit actually has a hidden
power, that makes it way more powerful and

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.810
dangerous than it appears.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:23.529
Or number 3: The name of Luffy's devil fruit
is actually not the Gomu Gomu no mi at all,

00:08:23.529 --> 00:08:27.129
but actually a legendary Zoan fruit.

00:08:27.129 --> 00:08:28.469
Let's start with one.

00:08:28.469 --> 00:08:33.090
This is based on a theory of mine about the
true nature of devil fruits that I've shared

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.090
before.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:37.170
If you want to hear my full line of reasoning
and proof for this, I suggest you check out

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.950
that video, but here's what you need to know:

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.390
It seems like devil fruits posses a will of
their own.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:47.910
Some sort of spirit, that is related to the
devil that gives its user their power.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:53.760
This seems likely as we have seen inanimate
objects gain consciousness by eating a devil

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:54.760
fruit.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:09:01.260
And we do know that the soul is a real thing
in One Piece from Brook's and Big Mom's abilities.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:05.150
Another major theme in one piece is that of
inherited will.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:10.250
I suspect that when someone eats a devil fruit,
they merge with their own soul and once the

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:14.830
user dies, a part of them lives on in the
devil fruit.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:19.120
Once someone else consumes this fruit, they
seems to take on some traits of the previous

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.120
user.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:23.440
We have seen this with Sabo, after eating
ace's fruit.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:29.390
Saying the same things and using the same
abilities, even though sabo never saw ace

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.160
use the fruit.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:46.440
[] Or with Big Mom, who behaves a lot like
mother caramel after consuming her---fruit.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:53.020
The point Im trying to make, is that the Gomu
fruit might have belonged to someone very

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:57.530
important, someone who's will Luffy now has
inherited.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:01.600
The prime two candidates here are Roger and
Joy Boy.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:07.660
Roger possibly finding the fruit on laugh
tale, eating it and then passing away soon

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.030
after.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:13.530
And indeed, only shortly after eating the
fruit, Luffy starts saying the same things

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:22.620
as Roger, something he keeps doing throughout
the story.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:28.850
So maybe, Luffy inherited Rogers or Joy boys
will through the GOmu GOmu no mi and that's

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.670
why it was so important to shanks.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:37.061
One thing that I think is important to address
here: If the fruit is that important, why

00:10:37.061 --> 00:10:40.250
didn't shanks eat it himself?

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:45.081
He stated in the story that neither he nor
any of his crew would eat a devil fruit, since

00:10:45.081 --> 00:10:47.100
they all need to be ablate swim.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:11:01.710
I'm not sure why, but I feel like this will
be important at some point.

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:22.410
Okay, Two.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:31.330
The Fruit has a hidden power, that we don't
yet know about.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:36.380
A possibility here is that the Gomu Gomu no
mi might be the perfect counter to another

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.380
fruit.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:43.440
We have already seen this happen with Enel,
who also wielded an incredibly powerful fruit.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:54.700
Another good fit could be the gura gura no
mi, the strongest paramecia fruit.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:12:01.260
In theory, Luffy's awakening might be the
perfect counter to Blackbeards abilities.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.220
Rubber doesn't break.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:08.250
And luffy as sun god Nika is the natural enemy
of Blackbeard's darkness.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:14.320
A problem with this idea is that the gura
gura no mi was still in possession of Whitebeard

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.720
12 years ago.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:22.730
So only if shanks knew that Blackbeard was
after the fruit would that make sense.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:29.510
But who knows, maybe the previous user was
Rocks and Shanks suspected Blackbeard would

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:34.450
try to gain it for himself.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:44.500
But maybe the power is not really related
to another fruit, but what it can do on its

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.500
own.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:49.880
Maybe the Gomu GOmu no mi in some way or form
is the key to changing the world.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:54.580
Some ability you will need on laugh tale to
unlock the one piece.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:13:00.131
One idea of how this might become relevant
is Luff's ability to enlarge his body parts

00:13:00.131 --> 00:13:01.990
into that of giants.

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:06.680
And as you know there is a lot of interest
in giants in one piece.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.990
Everyone wants them.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:13.120
The government, Big Mom even Kaido with the
numbers.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.740
Giants appear a lot in past events.

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:21.352
We have a D. Giant with Saul, we have the
giant frozen straw hat in marijoe and we even

00:13:21.352 --> 00:13:33.410
have seen a giant with Luffy's personality,
with Oars.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:38.970
So it's quite possible that Luffy's fruit
might allow him to turn into a giant, which

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.010
might be the key to bringing the dawn.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:48.860
The third option is probably my favorite one,
though I have to say upfront even for my standards,

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.100
it's a bit of a stretch.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.790
Since we're talking about Luffy, that might
be okay.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:58.330
And its an incredibly fun one.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:03.950
This theory is by a reddit user called The
biggest wheel, maybe a wheel of Time reference,

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:11.340
who proposes that the fruit the Gorosei are
discussing in chapter 1037 is actually Luffy's

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:16.420
and that the Gomu GOmu no mi is just a name
that the government came up with to erase

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.890
its true nature from history.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:24.110
The base of this theory is Luff's resemblence
with the Wisdom King Myouou [] as well as

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:31.230
the introduction of sun god Nika.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:34.260
Both of these gods can be linked to luffy.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:39.220
The idea then, is that Luffy actually ate
the mythical Zoan devil fruit of the wisdom

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:42.390
king.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:47.840
Basically Luffy's rubber abilities stay the
same, however they're just part of his creature,

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:55.870
like the healing ability for Marco's phoenix.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:01.300
Going off the latest chapter, that this fruit
hasn't awakened in centuries, the author then

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:06.260
argues, that the original owner of this fruit
might have been the very person, that was

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:10.920
seen as god Nika, in other words, Joy Boy
himself.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:16.340
So maybe Luffy is just awakening this very
unique devil fruit right now?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:21.790
The design of gear fourth is so fundamentally
different from anything we have seen so far

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:22.790
from luffy.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:27.780
Not only does he literally resemble a wisdom
king, but he has 3 forms of gear 4th, just

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:32.070
like Zoan fruits have multiple forms, as we
can see with chopper.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:44.270
The key to this is really, another unexplained
power that luffy has.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:49.120
Red hawk has been pretty much a mystery ever
since luffy was able to use it.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:55.290
And now we actively see him using red roc,
the only attack Kaido has bothered dodging

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:56.590
so far.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:16:01.870
Wisdom kings are usually depicted with firey
hair, just as sun god Nika seems to be.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:07.280
And Oda once made this street fighter Ken
version of Luffy, but Ken clearly doesn't

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:11.490
have fire hair.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:16.030
The design of the wisdom king pops up A lot
throughout one piece.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:21.540
We have Enel, who pretends to be a god, this
figure during the fire festival and of course

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:27.380
king, who has fire powers as well.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.380
Nika and the wisdom king.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:35.900
Shandora and Wano, two nations closely connected
through their history and their ties to the

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.310
ancient kingdom.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:42.650
So the craziest, but most existing option
here, is that Shanks stole the GOmu GOmu no

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:49.150
mi, because in reality it is one of the strongest
devil fruits out there and belonged to Joy

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:50.930
Boy himself.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:55.320
But even if we assume that the GOmu GOmu no
mi is just the rubber fruit, there are still

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:59.010
a lot of great possibilities for luffy's awakening.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.420
And there is a lot more to learn about devil
fruits.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:05.620
So check out either of these two video here
to learn More.

